 {"name":"Inn Off Capitol Park, Ascend Hotel Collection","aliases":"Inn Off Capitol Park, Ascend Hotel Collection|Inn Off Capitol Park","city":"sacramento","description":"Small courtyard hotel near Capitol Park at the western edge of Midtown, offering a quieter base within walking distance of Lavender Heights.","vibe":"low-key boutique-style lodging between the Capitol and queer nightlife","tags":"cozy,cultural,mixed","hours":"Reception and arrival service follow current property schedule; verify late check-in.","link":"https://www.choicehotels.com/california/sacramento/ascend-hotels/ca718","location":"1530 N Street, Sacramento, CA 95814, USA","lat":38.57356,"lng":-121.48718,"arrival":"Limited parking and compact historic layout require advance access and vehicle planning.","best":"Best for travellers prioritising walkability to both Capitol Park and Lavender Heights without a large-hotel lobby.","crowd":"Queer couples and solo visitors mix with state workers and budget-conscious city-break guests.","dress":"Everyday casual.","inclusion":"Choice Hotels publishes nondiscrimination protections including sexual orientation and gender identity; inclusion is not presented as queer ownership.","basis":"Current corporate policy, active property source and direct proximity to Sacramento's official LGBTQ district.","class":"Small Ascend Collection hotel","coords":"Exact official street address checked 2026-08-27.","sources":["https://media.choicehotels.com/diversity-equity-and-belonging","https://www.choicehotels.com/california/sacramento/ascend-hotels/ca718","https://www.visitsacramento.com/plan/lgbtq/"]},

